CM_ BO_ 457 "50 Hz companion of ACC_CONTROL (0x1C8), sent by the vision controller (RVU) one frame after it. The radarless Civic 2022 camera sends the same layout; driving its fields there was found to have no effect on braking";
CM_ SG_ 457 SET_SPEED "ACC set speed in kph (0x20 = 32 kph = 20 mph before any speed was set, keeps the last value when ACC is off)";
CM_ SG_ 457 LEAD_DISTANCE_MAYBE "255.00 m (0x639C) in every frame of a drive with nothing ahead; 2.52-2.54 m and 7.96-7.97 m, slowly drifting, in two drives started with a parked car in front (MDX Type S routes ad9840558640c31d/00000001 and 0000000b)";
CM_ SG_ 457 GAP_DISTANCE_MAYBE "4.66 m at standstill with 3 distance bars, 4.33 m with 2 bars, rising ~0.51 m per kph above 25 kph (steeper below): looks like the desired following distance";
CM_ BO_ 667 "vision controller 25 Hz status broadcast, all zero in every stock frame";
CM_ BO_ 744 "vision controller 10 Hz status broadcast, sent in the same frame as ACC_HUD/LKAS_HUD; 00 00 80 00 00 00 00 in every stock frame. Bytes 0-1 went c0 04 when the relay cut the controller off from its camera (route 00000008)";
CM_ BO_ 440773156 "vision controller 1 Hz status broadcast, XX 00 01 00 00 00 00 in every stock frame";
CM_ SG_ 440773156 STATE_MAYBE "constant within a drive, 0x00, 0x01 or 0x02 across drives (MDX Type S stock logs)";
